 <a href=\"/contact-us\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Contact</a>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"lg:hidden text-2xl\"><i class=\"fas fa-bars\"></i></button>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- HERO BANNER -->\n    <section class=\"hero-gradient h-[600px] flex items-center text-white relative\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-4 leading-tight\">\n                Premium <span class=\"text-yellow-400\">Air Handling Unit services Daman</span>\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl mb-8 max-w-2xl\">\n                Atlas Aircon provides industrial-grade <b>AHU repair, maintenance, and AMC services</b> across Nani Daman, Moti Daman, and Dabhel Industrial Estates. Specialized cooling for textile, pharma, and plastic units.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-[#25d366] hover:bg-green-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold flex items-center transition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                    <i class=\"fab fa-whatsapp mr-2 text-2xl\"></i> Chat on WhatsApp\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold transition\">\n                    Call: +91 97272 57141\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INTRODUCTION SECTION (Keyword focus) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"text-justify\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6\">Expert <span class=\"text-blue-700\">Air Handling Unit services Daman</span> for Industrial Excellence</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n                        In the thriving industrial landscape of the Union Territory, securing high-performance <b>Air Handling Unit services Daman</b> is non-negotiable for manufacturing consistency. At Atlas Aircon, we bring over 15 years of technical expertise to the coastal industrial belts of <b>Dabhel</b> and <b>Kachigam</b>. Our mission is to ensure that your industrial HVAC systems provide stable temperature and humidity control, which is vital for Daman&#8217;s diverse plastic, textile, and pharmaceutical manufacturing sectors.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-6\">\n                        An Air Handling Unit (AHU) acts as the lungs of your factory or commercial building. In a high-humidity environment like Daman, these units face challenges from salt-laden air and heavy industrial dust. Our specialized <b>Air Handling Unit services Daman</b> include deep coil cleaning, motor vibration analysis, and advanced filtration upgrades to combat these local environmental stressors. We service everything from <b>Single Skin AHUs</b> for small offices to massive <b>Double Skin AHUs</b> for large manufacturing bays.\n                    </p>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/ahu-manufacturers-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Air Handling Unit services Daman\" class=\"rounded-lg shadow-xl mb-6 w-full\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-lg border-t-4 border-blue-600\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Why Daman Industries Choose Us?</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Corrosion Protection:</b> Specialized marine-grade anti-corrosive coatings for AHU coils in Nani Daman coastal areas.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Rapid Response:</b> Strategic location near <b>Somnath Industrial Estate</b> for under-4-hour breakdown support.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Technical Precision:</b> Use of laser alignment for blower pulleys and digital CFM flow meters for audits.</span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-3\"></i>\n                            <span><b>Compliance Ready:</b> Service records provided for ISO 9001 and pharmaceutical cleanroom validation.</span>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- BRANDS WE REPAIR -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Which Brands We Repair &#038; Service</h2>\n            <p class=\"mb-10 text-gray-600\">We offer comprehensive technical repair and maintenance for all leading global and Indian AHU brands available in Daman and Vapi.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-8 items-center opacity-80\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Blue Star</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Daikin</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Carrier</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>York</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Zeco</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Edgetech</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Citizen</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Trane</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Voltas</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Hitachi</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>Mitsubishi</b></div>\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded hover:shadow-md transition\"><b>LG</b></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-sm font-bold\">\n                <a href=\"/blue-star-ac-service-center-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline px-2\">Blue Star Repair</a>\n                <a href=\"/carrier-ac-service-center-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline px-2\">Carrier Maintenance</a>\n                <a href=\"/daikin-ac-service-center-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline px-2\">Daikin Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"/voltas-ac-service-center-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline px-2\">Voltas Support</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- TYPES WE REPAIR -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center\">Types of AHU We Service in Daman</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Double Skin AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">The industry standard for Daman&#8217;s plastic and engineering units. We specialize in panel sealing and high-static blower repair.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-yellow-500 font-bold\">HVAC Details &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Cleanroom AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Dedicated to pharmaceutical plants in Kachigam. Includes HEPA integrity testing and validation servicing.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-green-500 font-bold\">Pharma Units &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border-l-4 border-blue-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">Ceiling Suspended AHUs</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-400 mb-4\">Space-saving solutions for commercial complexes in Nani Daman. We handle motor replacement and vibration damping.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/central-ac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"text-blue-500 font-bold\">Commercial AC &rarr;</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- INDUSTRIAL FOCUS SECTION (Daman Specific) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-gray-900\">Dedicated Service for Daman Industrial Clusters</h2>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg\">\n                <p class=\"mb-6 text-lg text-justify\">\n                    Daman is home to hundreds of manufacturing units that require consistent cooling and air filtration. Atlas Aircon offers specialized <b>Air Handling Unit services Daman</b> tailored to the specific humidity and salt-air challenges of this coastal Union Territory. Whether it is the <b>Dabhel Industrial Area</b> or the <b>Kadaiya Industrial Estate</b>, our mobile service teams are always on the move to keep your production lines running.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-blue-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-industry mr-2\"></i> Major Industrial &#038; GIDC Estates</h4>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Dabhel Industrial Area</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Somnath Industrial Estate</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Kachigam Industrial Area</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Bhimpore Industrial Estate</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Kadaiya Industrial Estate</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Dunetha Industrial Area</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Ringanwada GIDC</span>\n                            <span class=\"bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm\">Magarwada Estate</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-xl mb-4 text-green-800\"><i class=\"fas fa-warehouse mr-2\"></i> Specialized Service Parks</h4>\n                        <ul class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm\">\n                            <li>Marwad Hospital Area</li>\n                            <li>Devka Beach Road Hub</li>\n                            <li>Nani Daman Markets</li>\n                            <li>Moti Daman Admin Hub</li>\n                            <li>Khariwad Commercial</li>\n                            <li>Bhenslore Hub</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PRICE TABLE -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Industrial AHU Service Price List (Daman Region)</h2>\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white uppercase text-sm\">\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">AHU Maintenance Service / Part</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Estimated Cost</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-4 border\">Product Link</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU Preventive Maintenance Service</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 1,800 &#8211; 4,200</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/shop\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Book Now</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Pre-Filter</b> (Standard G4 Grade)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 550 &#8211; 1,800</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/pre-filter\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">View Item</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Fine Filter</b> (F7 / F9 Grade)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 2,500 &#8211; 6,500</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/filters\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">View Item</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Cooling Coil Restoration</b> (Anti-Corrosive)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 4,500 &#8211; 15,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/cooling-coils\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Get Quote</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>Fan Motor Rewinding</b> (Industrial Grade)</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 5,500 &#8211; 18,000</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/fan-motor\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Inquiry</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 bg-gray-50\">\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><b>AHU V-Belt Set Replacement</b></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\">₹ 900 &#8211; 2,800</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-4 border\"><a href=\"/v-belts\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold underline\">Buy Spares</a></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 italic text-center\">Note: Prices vary based on tonnage, CFM capacity, and actual distance to the site within Daman district.</p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- PROS AND CONS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Pros and Cons of Professional AHU Maintenance</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-green-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-800\">Key Advantages (Pros)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Extended Equipment Life:</b> Proper lubrication and cleaning double the lifespan of expensive AHU systems.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Energy Savings:</b> Clean coils and balanced fans reduce power consumption by up to 28% in Daman&#8217;s hot climate.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Consistent Humidity Control:</b> Vital for plastic molding and textile printing accuracy.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Reduced Downtime:</b> Spotting worn-out belts before they snap avoids emergency plant shutdowns.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Healthier Workplace:</b> Eliminates airborne pathogens and mold from the cooling system.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Quiet Operation:</b> Professional blower balancing removes irritating floor vibrations.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-plus-circle text-green-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Compliance:</b> Essential for maintaining cleanroom standards for the pharmaceutical export market.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-l-8 border-red-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-800\">Risks of Neglect (Cons)</h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-3\">\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Rapid Salt Corrosion:</b> Coastal air eats unprotected AHU coils within 12 months without maintenance.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Skyrocketing Bills:</b> Clogged filters force the motor to draw 2x the standard electricity.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Microbial Growth:</b> Humid drain pans become breeding grounds for bacteria and bad odors.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Catastrophic Failure:</b> A seized bearing can cause the entire motor and blower assembly to burn out.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Voided Warranty:</b> Manufacturers often reject warranty claims if no service records are maintained.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Poor Air Hygiene:</b> Leading to &#8220;Sick Building Syndrome&#8221; among industrial workers.</li>\n                        <li><i class=\"fas fa-minus-circle text-red-500 mr-2\"></i> <b>Water Flooding:</b> Blocked condensate drains cause leakages into factory ceilings.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ERROR CODES -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">Common AHU Error Codes &#038; Fixes</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E1: Low Airflow</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Check for dirty filters or belt slippage. Inspect the blower motor status.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E4: Pressure Fault</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Clean the cooling coil. Check if the VFD frequency is set correctly for the duct load.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">E9: Drainage Overflow</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Flush the drain pipe with pressurized air. Clear the condensate pan of slime.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-6 border rounded hover:border-blue-500 transition shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">F0: Motor Overload</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs\"><b>Solution:</b> Verify voltage supply. Check motor bearings for friction or heat buildup.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQS -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-gray-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-10 text-center\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">1. Why are Air Handling Unit services Daman more frequent than other cities?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Daman is a coastal Union Territory with high humidity and salt content in the air. This causes faster filter clogging and coil corrosion, necessitating regular monthly or quarterly checkups.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">2. Do you provide AHU AMC in Nani Daman industrial areas?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, Atlas Aircon offers specialized Annual Maintenance Contracts (AMC) for all GIDC and industrial estates including Dabhel, Kachigam, and Somnath.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">3. Can you handle large double skin AHU for textile mills?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Absolutely. We specialize in maintaining large-tonnage AHUs used in textile and plastic injection molding plants that require high static pressure blower systems.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">4. How do I know if my AHU filters need replacement?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">If you notice reduced airflow, increased motor noise, or musty smells from the vents, it&#8217;s time for a filter inspection. We recommend pressure gauge audits to confirm.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">5. Do you supply genuine spare parts in Daman?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we maintain an inventory of genuine belts, motors, and sensors for brands like Blue Star, Carrier, and Daikin to ensure zero downtime for your plant.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">6. Can you perform HEPA validation for pharma units?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer complete filter installation and testing support for pharmaceutical cleanrooms in the Kachigam and Dabhel industrial belts.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">7. Is 24/7 breakdown service available for industrial clients?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">For our AMC partners, we provide round-the-clock priority breakdown support to ensure production critical areas remain operational.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">8. Do you provide duct cleaning along with AHU service?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide an all-in-one solution that includes internal AHU deep cleaning and duct network inspection to ensure maximum air hygiene.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">9. What are the signs of a failing AHU motor?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Watch out for excessive heat on the motor casing, grinding noises from bearings, or a significant drop in blower RPM.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">10. How can I get a quote for my facility in Daman?</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Simply call us at +91 97272 57141 or send us a WhatsApp message with your unit capacity, and our engineer will visit for a site audit.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- AREAS SERVED LIST (Daman Specific) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white border-t\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\">Service Locations Across Daman</h2>\n            <div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed overflow-y-auto max-h-40 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n                Nani Daman | Moti Daman | Dabhel | Somnath | Kachigam | Bhimpore | Kadaiya | Dunetha | Ringanwada | Magarwada | Devka | Marwad | Khariwad | Bhenslore | Jampore | Kathiria | Varkund | Dunetha GIDC | Dabhel Industrial Area | Somnath Industrial Estate | Kachigam Industrial Area | Kadaiya Industrial Estate | Ringanwada GIDC | Bhimpore Industrial Estate | Marwad Hospital Area | Nani Daman Market | Moti Daman Fort Area | Devka Beach Road Hub.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FOOTER -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white section-padding\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon\" class=\"h-10 mb-6 brightness-0 invert\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm\">Industrial HVAC Specialists providing <b>Air Handling Unit services Daman</b> and Vapi for over 15 years. Quality and reliability combined.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\">Core Services</h4>\n                <ul class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm space-y-2\">\n                    <li><a href=\"/ac-service-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Industrial AC Repair</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/hvac-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">HVAC Maintenance</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Chiller Service</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/cold-room-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Cold Room Care</a></li>\n                    <li><a href=\"/ducting-repair-services-vadodara\" class=\"hover:text-white underline\">Duct Cleaning</a></li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold mb-4\